    "regime_notes": "Primary 20-day horizon passed the benchmark gates (absolute IC >= 0.0070 and absolute ICIR >= 0.0840). The 5-day result was below the IC gate and the 10-day result was negative; use as a slower 20-day research signal rather than a short-horizon forecast. Small cross-asset universe requires conservative interpretation.",
    "validation_timestamp": "2031-12-11T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "tags": ["reversal", "cross-asset", "dispersion", "risk-conditioned"]
